{"id":"00074","root":"uni00074_1","name":{"ja":"天華","en":"Tenka"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"天華","en":"Tenka"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-01-16","limited":false,"characterId":61,"profile":{"ja":"二尾の妖孤。元は伝説の妖孤・九尾の狐の一部。過去に九尾の狐が人々に倒され殺生石となり周囲の人々に災いを振りまいていた。あるとき一人の僧によって殺生石が破壊され、石のかけらが世界各地へと飛び散る。その飛び散った欠片の一つが長い年月を経て力を持ち、妖孤の姿へと変貌したのが天華である。欠片から生まれたことにより、尻尾の数は二本しかなく力も九尾より格段に劣る。幼さの残るやや子供っぽい性格。だが性質は受け継いでいて、男を惑わし堕落する様を楽しんでいる。また力のあるものには、堕落させる際に天華の核となっている殺生石の欠片が発する毒素を相手に与え、狂人に変貌させて楽しむこともある。","en":"Tenka is a two-tailed yokai spirit, originally a fragment of the legendary nine-tailed fox. Long ago the original nine-tailed fox was slain, becoming a killing stone that spread calamity. A monk later shattered the stone, scattering shards worldwide. One shard, after ages, gained power and transformed into Tenka. Because she was born from a fragment, she has only two tails and far less power than the original. She retains a childlike, somewhat immature personality, yet she inherits the fox's nature—she enjoys leading men astray and corrupting them. When she corrupts a powerful individual, she also injects toxin from the killing-stone fragment at her core, turning the victim into a madman for her amusement."},"illustrator":"デコセンタクジ","voiceActor":"葉月まぁち","forms":[{"id":"uni00074_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1060,2120],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[109,218],"def":[131,262],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","90007"]},{"id":"uni00074_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1620,3240],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[153,306],"def":[197,394],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","90007","90008"]},{"id":"uni00074_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2180,4361],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[202,405],"def":[268,537],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","90007","90008"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"na